# Repository ceiling for native demo entry permission. Host overrides may only
# turn an `on` value off. An off sleeve still receives signals and can cancel or
# exit; it cannot open or grow exposure. Flatten is a separate durable engine
# command. Strict KEY=value; accepted values are on/off.
LONG_SLEEVE=on
CARRY_SLEEVE=on
# Real money has no toggle here. The single arming switch is REAL_MONEY=true
# in /etc/liquidity-migration/bybit-mainnet.env, set by the owner's own hand
# next to the live API key; the installed risk profile decides which mainnet
# sleeves run and at what share. A git commit must never be able to arm.
